// =====================================================
### 1. 전체 상품 목록 (시드 데이터 10개 확인)
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### 2. 검색 + 페이지네이션
GET http://localhost:3000/products?keyword=애플&limit=5

### 3. 정렬
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=recent&limit=3

### 4. 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 5. 존재 안 하는 id (404 응답 확인)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/999

### 6. 생성
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "테스트 상품",
    "description": "API 테스트용",
    "price": 10000,
    "tags": ["테스트"]
}

### 7. 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 15000
}

### 8. 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/11



// =====================================================


###
GET http://localhost:3000/articles

###
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1

###
POST http://localhost:3000/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "테스트 제목",
    "content": "테스트 내용임 ㅇㅇ"
}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/articles/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "사실 뻥임 ㅋㅋ"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/articles/11



// ===================================================== Comment
### Product 1번 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content":"이 상품 가격 협상 가능한가요??"
}

### Product 1번 댓글 목록 (첫 페이지, limit 3)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments?limit=3

### Product 1번 댓글 목록 (다음 페이지, 위 응답의 nextCursor 값 사용)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments?limit=3&cursor=2

### Article 1번 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "공감합니다!"
}

### Article 1번 댓글 목록
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments

### 댓글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "수정된 댓글 내용입니다."
}

### 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comments/1

### Cascade 테스트: Product 삭제 -> 해당 댓글들도 자동 삭제 확인
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1
### 이후 Product 1의 댓글 조회 시 빈 배열이어야 함
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments